==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 32 seconds<sup>960f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level is an easy one. Simply just use [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe cat]] for the [[Metal Hippoe|Metal Hippoes]], [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] for the [[Doge Dark|Doge Darks]], and [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] for everything else.

